WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.080
Long ago, severe floods struck China.

00:00:04.430 --> 00:00:08.030
Yu accepted the task, determined to bring the floods under control.

00:00:08.380 --> 00:00:13.204
He traveled to many places, surveying the mountains and rivers.

00:00:13.554 --> 00:00:18.066
Together with the people, he set to work dredging the river channels.

00:00:18.416 --> 00:00:22.712
Everyone cleared the blocked channels, and the floodwaters slowly receded.

00:00:23.062 --> 00:00:27.670
The clear river water flowed onward toward the sea.

00:00:28.020 --> 00:00:33.588
Working away from home for years, Yu missed his family dearly.

00:00:33.938 --> 00:00:37.226
Three times he passed his own door, and never went in.

00:00:37.576 --> 00:00:42.184
His family stood at the door, watching his figure recede into the distance.

00:00:42.534 --> 00:00:47.262
Holding back his longing, Yu hurried on to the next flood site.

00:00:47.612 --> 00:00:52.172
In the end, Yu successfully controlled the floods and won the people's reverence.

00:00:52.522 --> 00:00:57.130
Yu later became the leader, and his son Qi founded the Xia dynasty.

